{
    "commit": "51292681cec46e8ee7b50f4431bfbb032a67fb37",
    "commitSubject": "Replay the post-generation chain offline instead of on a GPU",
    "note": "Four models on mug.png plus the two print-feature configurations, and three runs each of TRELLIS.2 and SAM 3D. Every run on an NVIDIA A10G with weights warm on EFS; the six smoke runs on g5.8xlarge and two of the repeats on g5.2xlarge, which Batch chose -- same GPU, different instance size. The repeats isolate run-to-run variance from the GPU, and they show TRELLIS.2 is not reproducible on identical hardware while SAM 3D is.",
